{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"105942","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/105942","key":"MC-249171","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Mar/22 5:47 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>The map color for mangrove logs is incorrect. Unlike the stripped mangrove log, which appears red on a map, the mangrove log matches the color of acacia logs on a map, which is orange.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Obtain and fill a map</li>\n\t<li>Place upward-facing acacia logs<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The logs appear orange on the map</li>\n\t<li>Place upward-facing stripped mangrove logs<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The logs appear red on the map</li>\n\t<li>Place upward-facing mangrove logs<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The logs appear orange on the map</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n<p>The mangrove log color would be red, like the map color of stripped mangrove logs.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualbehavior\"></a>Actual behavior</h3>\n<p>The mangrove log color is orange, like the map color of acacia logs.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Mar/22 2:10 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/138857","id":"138857","filena